#: ../../../readme.md:26
msgid ""
"Highlight.js is a syntax highlighter written in JavaScript. It works in the "
"browser as well as on the server. It can work with pretty much any markup, "
"doesn’t depend on any other frameworks, and has automatic language detection."
msgstr ""

