#: ../../../readme.md:440
msgid ""
"**Note:** *The CDN-hosted `highlight.min.js` package doesn't bundle every "
"language.* It would be very large. You can find our list of \"common\" "
"languages that we bundle by default on our [download page][5]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:443
msgid "Download prebuilt CDN assets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:445
msgid ""
"You can also download and self-host the same assets we serve up via our own "
"CDNs.  We publish those builds to the [cdn-release](https://github.com/"
"highlightjs/cdn-release) GitHub repository.  You can easily pull individual "
"files off the CDN endpoints with `curl`, etc; if say you only needed "
"`highlight.min.js` and a single CSS file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:447
msgid ""
"There is also an npm package [@highlightjs/cdn-assets](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@highlightjs/cdn-assets) if pulling the assets in via `npm` or "
"`yarn` would be easier for your build process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:449
msgid "Download from our website"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:451
msgid ""
"The [download page][5] can quickly generate a custom single-file minified "
"bundle including only the languages you desire."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:453
msgid ""
"**Note:** [Building from source](#build-from-source) can produce slightly "
"smaller builds than the website download."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:456
msgid "Install via NPM package"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:458
msgid ""
"Our NPM package including all supported languages can be installed with NPM "
"or Yarn:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:460
msgid ""
"npm install highlight.js\n"
"# or\n"
"yarn add highlight.js\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:466
msgid ""
"There is also another npm package [@highlightjs/cdn-assets](https://www."
"npmjs.com/package/@highlightjs/cdn-assets) that contains prebuilt CDN assets "
"including [ES6 Modules that can be imported in browser](#browser-es6-"
"modules):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:468
msgid ""
"npm install @highlightjs/cdn-assets\n"
"# or\n"
"yarn add @highlightjs/cdn-assets\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:474
msgid "Alternatively, you can build the NPM package from source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:477
msgid "Build from Source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:479
msgid "The [current source code][10] is always available on GitHub."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:481
msgid ""
"node tools/build.js -t node\n"
"node tools/build.js -t browser :common\n"
"node tools/build.js -t cdn :common\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../readme.md:487
msgid "See our [building documentation][6] for more information."
msgstr ""

